<!--
  Intentionally empty and intentionally NOT importing the parent.

  MSBuild walks up the directory tree until it finds a Directory.Build.props, so without this file
  the analyzed legacy solutions under TestLegacyProjects/ inherit the LegacyLens repository settings
  (Nullable=enable, TreatWarningsAsErrors=true). That injected thousands of phantom CS86xx errors
  into their baselines and made the reports describe our build configuration instead of their code.

  Test subjects must be analyzed exactly as their own repositories define them.
-->
<Project />
